sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as UI
    participant App as Application layer
    participant Rust as Rust
    participant Disk as Disk
    UI->>App: User operation (command)
    App->>App: Update in-memory model
    App->>Rust: Save (auto save or Ctrl+S)
    Rust->>Rust: Validate
    Rust->>Disk: Write body to temp file, replace
    Rust->>Disk: Write metadata to temp file, replace
    Rust->>Rust: Record content hashes
    Rust-->>App: Result
